              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mar 1.39",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yesoni Galilaya ch'ufa keesa dedeeme Maneeni Waaqa iti kad'atani keesati nama barsiise, Odu Dansa ta Finna odeese, d'ukubafi miid'ama gosa ch'ufa nama fayyise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tanaafi gurri isaa lafa Shamu ch'ufa gahe, nama d'ukuba qabuufi ka fayyad'abaani gaargale, ka jinni qabu, ka gagabdufa, ka naafatele isatiini d'ufani, inni worra ch'ufa fayyise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gumiini guddooni ta Galilayatiifi ta dira kud'ani, ta Yerusalemutiifi lafa Yahuditiifi ta d'aatu Yordani keesa ch'ufti isa gula yaate.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.4.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
